(slower-b747-sv01-3dof)
*title B747 local trim and short level-flight baseline
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*units/fmt alt m f.3
*units/fmt vel m/sec f.3
*units/fmt mass kg f.3
*units/fmt long deg f.3
*units/fmt lat deg f.3
*units/fmt gama deg f.3
*units/fmt psi deg f.3
*trajectory 1 b747 start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=1000.0 long=0.0 lat=0.0 vel=200.0 gama=0.0 psi=90.0 time=0.0 mass=288756.9
  *segment 1 local-trim
    *integ dtprnt=0.2 dt=0.05
    *fly alpha=3.1
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) sref=510.96672
    *prop thrust=(thrust) mdot=0
    *when time>2.0 stop
*end
